Theory positioning
proto14 N_arc=32 is an old exploratory local-ULA aperture, not the current complete working array.
The engineering working array is the 65-column sector selected dynamically by arr_cyl(cfg, azCtr_deg).
Level 2 tests whether the full 65-column sector can be used through a real cylindrical subarray-manifold MUSIC model.
Level 2 remains a 1D azimuth algorithm: 32 elevation layers are coherently combined and then compressed away.

Route definitions
route 1: level2_ula_root_music_65col_baseline | 65x32 -> 32-layer combining -> doa_root_music_array with d_eq
route 2: level2_center_real_grid_music | FBSS En -> center-subarray real cylindrical grid-MUSIC
route 3: level2_subarray_avg_real_grid_music_forward | FBSS En -> all forward FBSS subarrays real cylindrical grid-MUSIC
route 4: level2_subarray_avg_real_grid_music_fb | FBSS En -> all forward/backward FBSS subarrays real cylindrical grid-MUSIC (main level-2 route)

